# The fonts Palmframe ships, and where they go on the target.
#
# One file per line: <source> <destination> <set>, whitespace separated.
# A relative source is relative to the repository root; an absolute one is a
# file on the build host. <set> is `base` (always installed: without it text
# is wrong somewhere) or `emoji` (optional, 10 MB, colour emoji).
#
# Why these and no others. Every application goes through kit.start, which
# pins Geist for sans and the first of JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-Regular,
# DejaVuSansMono, LiberationMono-Regular for mono, by an absolute host path;
# palmy's load_font finds the same file *name* anywhere under /usr/share/fonts
# when that path does not exist, so the directories below are free choices
# kept close to what Arch uses. Geist is a 32 KB Latin subset, so DejaVu Sans
# rides along as the fallback face for everything past it: Greek, Cyrillic,
# arrows, box drawing, math. palmy's discovery is a plain directory walk -- no
# fontconfig, no cache -- so installing the file is all it takes.
#
# Licenses: Geist, JetBrains Mono (Nerd Font glyphs MIT) and Noto Color Emoji
# are SIL OFL 1.1; DejaVu is the Bitstream Vera license plus public-domain
# changes. Each license text is installed beside the fonts.

parity/web/public/fonts/Geist-400.ttf                     /usr/share/fonts/geist/Geist-400.ttf                     base
parity/web/public/fonts/Geist-500.ttf                     /usr/share/fonts/geist/Geist-500.ttf                     base
parity/web/public/fonts/Geist-600.ttf                     /usr/share/fonts/geist/Geist-600.ttf                     base
parity/web/public/fonts/Geist-700.ttf                     /usr/share/fonts/geist/Geist-700.ttf                     base
distro/apps/licenses/Geist-OFL.txt                        /usr/share/licenses/fonts/Geist-OFL.txt                  base
/usr/share/fonts/TTF/JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-Regular.ttf    /usr/share/fonts/TTF/JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-Regular.ttf   base
/usr/share/fonts/TTF/JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-Italic.ttf     /usr/share/fonts/TTF/JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-Italic.ttf    base
/usr/share/licenses/ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd-basic/OFL.txt /usr/share/licenses/fonts/JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt          base
/usr/share/fonts/TTF/DejaVuSans.ttf                       /usr/share/fonts/TTF/DejaVuSans.ttf                      base
/usr/share/licenses/ttf-dejavu/LICENSE                    /usr/share/licenses/fonts/DejaVu-LICENSE.txt             base
/usr/share/fonts/noto/NotoColorEmoji.ttf                  /usr/share/fonts/noto/NotoColorEmoji.ttf                 emoji
/usr/share/licenses/noto-fonts-emoji/LICENSE              /usr/share/licenses/fonts/NotoColorEmoji-OFL.txt         emoji
